    "show_share": true,
    "description": "On February 17, 2024, Vitalis Obonyo received the Award for Excellence in Student Leadership at the global convocation ceremony. He was recognized for his leadership efforts during his time as a Master of Education student at AKU's Institute for Educational Development, East Africa (IED EA) in Dar es Salaam.",
